The first expanded conformance run is green except for an over-broad privacy assertion, which I corrected. I also spotted a real lifecycle gap during review: an accepted message source could suspend past stop, leaving its Apple reply gate dependent on a late callback. I’m tightening that now so stop retires every in-flight route immediately and source completion cannot retain or revive the adapter.
