The full core gate passed with 218 tests and a post-test build. During the final code audit I removed a subtle bounded-memory issue: completed snapshot lookups now cancel their retirement subscription, so repeated successful messages cannot accumulate wait tasks until stop. The regression test now also proves stop completes an in-flight reply before the source is released. I’m rerunning the affected normal/TSan/full gates on that tightened version.
